  "description": "Upgrade your truck with OEDRO Drop Running Boards — the perfect blend of style, strength, and convenience. Designed for the 2019-2026 Chevy Silverado & GMC Sierra 1500 Crew Cab, 2020-2025 Silverado/Sierra 2500HD 3500HD Crew Cab, these heavy-duty carbon steel side steps provide effortless access, superior protection, and rugged appeal for everyday driving or off-road adventures.\nFeatures\n6-inch side pedals.: The two-level layout provides better convenience for vehicles equipped with lifting kits and oversized tires.\nTri Convex Platform design: The three-tube and tri convex Platform design provides more protection for the bottom and sides of the vehicle while preventing it from getting stuck on the rocker or hanging obstacles.\nBolt-fixed installation: Welded brackets provide extra strength without cutting or drilling.\nStrong and sturdy: The unique powder coating has anti-rust and corrosion resistance, so it can be driven under any conditions.\nTwo-Stair Design for Easy Entry: Features a unique dual-step layout that provides safe and convenient access for passengers of all ages and helps load or unload gear from the roof.\n1-year warranty. For your safety, professional installation is highly recommended\nFitment\nCompatible with 2019-2026 Chevy Silverado & GMC Sierra 1500 Crew Cab\nCompatible with 2020-2026 Chevy Silverado & GMC Sierra 2500HD 3500HD Crew Cab",
